                <start-time>00:03:19,100</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:22,360</end-time>
                <translation>就是说自由主义者的同时也是保守的</translation>
                <original>じゃあその自由主義の人が保守的であっても</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" torder="1" time="" index="55" vertical="0" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:03:22,360</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:24,675</end-time>
                <translation>其实也并没有矛盾吧</translation>
                <original>矛盾は実はないじゃない</original>
