            <t id="" torder="1" time="" index="58" vertical="0" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:03:30,393</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:33,875</end-time>
                <translation>这样的态度感到厌恶</translation>
                <original>みたいなそういうあり方をけぎらいしたんですよね</original>
