            </t>
            <t id="" torder="1" time="" index="61" vertical="0" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:03:40,675</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:45,975</end-time>
                <translation>自由主义是（略）最高尚、最宽容的制度
