                <start-time>00:13:48,850</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:51,640</end-time>
                <translation>才更接近真理或自由</translation>
                <original>より真理とか自由になるという風に思いがちだけども</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" torder="1" time="" index="254" vertical="0" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:13:51,640</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:53,125</end-time>
                <translation>但他说不是这样的</translation>
                <original>違うって言うんですよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" torder="1" time="" index="255" vertical="0" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:13:53,125</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:55,825</end-time>
                <translation>比如葬礼就是很好的例子</translation>
                <original>例えばお葬式なんかもそうだと思うんですよね</original>
                <spell/>
