                <start-time>00:15:15,625</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:19,300</end-time>
                <translation>结果 自由本身的底部被凿开了一个洞</translation>
                <original>その結果自由そのものの底に穴が開いて</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" torder="1" time="" index="276" vertical="0" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:15:19,300</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:22,210</end-time>
                <translation>自由就这样被摧毁了</translation>
                <original>破壊されてしまうというのに</original>
